quote.text:
This guy popped 1 good coin that he himself didn’t even take to 100 Million + and thinks he’s the shit.

Next couple of days he’s deployed a coin for everything, and anytime a new coin comes out everyone from that last one comes killing the previous coin and destroying countless people’s wallets.

He then goes on to berate himself as some “hero” when he’s scamming people who follow him, this is not what the space was meant for serial deployers have no place among us. 

@Supermanonchain shame on you for taking advantage of so many people to profit, @blknoiz06 you should make it clear this is not what was intended for the memecoin space. 

@Pumpfun get your shit together and stop allowing people to blatantly scam and deceive people on the daily basis.

